  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: companionsquest1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930426006
    - rid: 4351267874930426007
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: -so yeah. That Nazeem guy isn't going to be bothering anybody for a while.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930426009
    - rid: 4351267874930426011
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Good work. Here''s your pay:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930426012
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Farkas hands Natsuki a bag containing 100 septims.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930426013
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Actually, Skjor was looking for you.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930426016
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: The bald guy with a white left eye?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930426017
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Ha!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930426020
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: That's the one. He should be downstairs.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930426021
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, see ya around Farkas.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930426022
    - rid: 4351267874930426023
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930426024
    - rid: 4351267874930426026
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, you wanted to see me?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930426027
    - rid: 4351267874930426028
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19994ba39eb37754eb26e44446994a72, type: 2}
    dialog: I did. Your time, it seems, has come.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930426029
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ... what?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930426031
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19994ba39eb37754eb26e44446994a72, type: 2}
    dialog: Last week, a scholar came to us.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930426034
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19994ba39eb37754eb26e44446994a72, type: 2}
    dialog: He said he knew the whereabouts of one of the fragments of Wuuthrad.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19994ba39eb37754eb26e44446994a72, type: 2}
    dialog: He seemed a fool to me, but if he's right, the honor of the Companion's
      demands that we seek it out.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, what's Wuuthrad-?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930426035
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19994ba39eb37754eb26e44446994a72, type: 2}
    dialog: The axe Ysgramor himself held in battle!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930426036
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19994ba39eb37754eb26e44446994a72, type: 2}
    dialog: Through that weapon we maintain the lineage between us and the harbingers
      of old.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19994ba39eb37754eb26e44446994a72, type: 2}
    dialog: We already have some of the fragments on display here in Jorrvaskr.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki thinks to herself, recalling the weird black pieces of metal
      that are affixed to one of the supporting beams near the stairway.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930426037
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: So you want me to go find this fragment of Wuuthrad?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930426038
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19994ba39eb37754eb26e44446994a72, type: 2}
    dialog: That's right; this task will serve as your Trial.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Trial?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930426039
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19994ba39eb37754eb26e44446994a72, type: 2}
    dialog: That's right, if you carry yourself with honor, you will become a true
      Companion.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (I thought I already was one...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267894911041718
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, where am I heading, then?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267894911041719
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19994ba39eb37754eb26e44446994a72, type: 2}
    dialog: Dustman's Cairn.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19994ba39eb37754eb26e44446994a72, type: 2}
    dialog: Farkas will be your Shield-Brother on this venture; try not to disappoint
      or get him killed.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267894911041720
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (... whatever.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267894911041721
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki makes her way back upstairs, looking for Farkas.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267894911041722
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267894911041723
    - rid: 4351267894911041724
    - rid: 4351267894911041734
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, Farkas-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267894911041726
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Need something?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267894911041728
    - rid: 4351267894911041729
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, yeah...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Skjor said you would be my Shield-Brother for my Trial, or whatever.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267894911041730
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: You're having your trial already?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah we're going to Dustman's Cairn to get a fragment of Wuuthrad...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Wherever that is.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267894911041731
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, I know where that is. Follow me.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki does as Farkas says, following his lead.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267894911041732
    - rid: 4351267894911041733
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267894911041735
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: This is the place.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267894911041736
    - rid: 4351267894911041737
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (It hasn't even been a day, and I'm already going back in one of <i>these</i>
      places...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782272
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Let's just get this over with.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782273
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782274
    - rid: 4351267917689782275
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Pickaxes...?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki looks around, noticing the pickaxes and shovels strewn about
      the entrance.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782328
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: What about them?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782327
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Someone's been digging here. And recently. Tread lightly.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you think whoever they are is after the Wuuthrad piece too?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Maybe, or maybe they just want the riches of the dead.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782329
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Great. Just great.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782330
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782331
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, do you do this kind of thing often?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782332
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: This kind of thing?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: You know, going underground into dungeons and stuff...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: I wish.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782333
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Mostly we just deal with braggards who can't shut up, or the occasional
      creature trashing a farm.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: So this is a nice change of pace.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782334
    - rid: 4351267917689782335
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm. It seems the way ahead is blocked.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: There should be some lever nearby to open that gate.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki begins looking around for something that looks like a lever.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782336
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Eventually, she finds one in a small alcove.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782337
    - rid: 4351267917689782338
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Farkas! I think I found it!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782339
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Give it a pull, then!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782340
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki gives it a pull, and-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782341
    - rid: 4351267917689782342
    - rid: 4351267917689782343
    - rid: 4351267917689782344
    - rid: 4351267917689782346
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, crap.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Now look what you've gotten yourself into.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782347
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: No worries, just sit tight. I'll find the release.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782348
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: You better...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782349
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: As Farkas turns around to find the release, he is surrounded by men with
      their weapons drawn.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782350
    - rid: 4351267917689782351
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1d2575c9b40aae842a0e56edb93f9f48, type: 2}
    dialog: Which one is he?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1d2575c9b40aae842a0e56edb93f9f48, type: 2}
    dialog: It doesn't matter. As long as he wears that armor, he dies.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1d2575c9b40aae842a0e56edb93f9f48, type: 2}
    dialog: We can take it back as a trophy-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: You'll die trying.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: As the armed men try to attack Farkas, he transforms into his werewolf
      form.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh god...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: As quickly as the fight starts, it ends.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782352
    - rid: 4351267917689782353
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: All of the would-be werewolf killers lie dead.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Farkas, still in his werewolf form, wanders out of sight briefly.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki hears a clicking sound, and-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: I hope I didn't scare you.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782354
    - rid: 4351267917689782355
    - rid: 4351267917689782356
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: So you people really are werewolves...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782357
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: It's a blessing only given to some of us.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Blessing?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782358
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I wouldn't call being able to turn into a monster a blessing.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782359
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Who told you about our secret, anyway?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782360
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: A trusted friend.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782361
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Hmm.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782362
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Let's just get moving. We still have the draugr to worry about.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Great. Draugr.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782363
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sure enough, as the two of them progress through the Cairn, they encounter
      draugr.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782364
    - rid: 4351267917689782365
    - rid: 4351267917689782366
    - rid: 4351267917689782367
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782368
    - rid: 4351267917689782369
    - rid: 4351267917689782370
    - rid: 4351267917689782371
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782375
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782376
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782378
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782379
    - rid: 4351267917689782384
    - rid: 4351267917689782380
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Sure.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782398
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: So, uh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782399
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you know who those people who attacked you were?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782400
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Because it seemed too personal for them to just be some random bandits,
      or something.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, they're probably Silverhand.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782401
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Silverhand?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: They're a bunch of spineless thugs who think that just being werewolf
      hunters makes them honorable.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: So, they know that the Companions has werewolves?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Seems so.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Not that they would need us to be werewolves to get in our way, anyway.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: What do you mean by that?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: I told you they were spineless, many innocent people have gotten hurt
      in their crusade against all werewolves.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782402
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782403
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Perhaps on queue, the Silverhand make themselves known by ambushing Farkas
      and Natsuki.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267917689782404
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
